{"version":1,"key":"card:485","content":{"id":485,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"46b91f50-386a-41e2-bf8e-0ac7e8906e32","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 Rust 中，只有相同类型的数字才能计算"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"861c0a9e-17c2-4bcc-8a39-1a56ed9ac2a9","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"26f9753c-f7e9-4034-ba16-0ff2cd6417f2","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"fn main() {\n    let i = -1;\n    let f = 2.0;\n\n    let num = i * f;\n\n    println!(\"{}\", num);\n}","collabId":"0fcdb97b-82d1-4e5d-a397-7c110c0b76d6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"97605cad-1eef-479b-9315-7a6079319d7a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述程序编译失败，错误信息如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"552f244b-f4ad-4489-bc27-995f90cff4b0","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"cbac4eee-e5d5-4c05-8315-ec14e5831434","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let num = i * f;\n            ^ no implementation for `{integer} * {float}`","collabId":"45a274da-f83d-4ac0-9af6-2b60d82882a9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a981eb40-5dd7-445b-b274-9c3edab38dc2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"即使运算的双方否为整数，但是类型不同也是不行的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"4180346a-cc8e-45ca-88ed-976b7601af7f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"e6ea7f0a-0c1f-492d-9921-75b185521a5a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"fn main() {\n    let i_64 = -1_i64;\n    let i_32 = 2_i32;\n    \n    let num = i_64 * i_32;\n\n    println!(\"{}\", num);\n}","collabId":"30c2e24d-6b9b-4754-98c1-41035dd569b8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"e87b3bdd-2b49-4124-bda4-c31242427bed","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d4b6666f-be47-46a8-b741-491e094a570a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let num = i_64 * i_32;\n                 ^^^^ expected `i64`, found `i32`","collabId":"f089cde9-f9de-4d0f-aca8-8128df19f575","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"430d8258-c198-43bb-8cbb-204711f46a19","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 C 等其他语言中，数字进行运算时如果类型不同会进行隐式类型转换，将低精度的类型转换为高精度的类型（整数转换为浮点数或者整数转换为更高精度的整数）然后进行计算，得到的结果也是浮点数，但是在 Rust 中"},{"type":"underline","color":"red","lineType":"solid","colorSelectOpen":false,"tauContract":"88d9b3835432080ad1c02f70cd42c22df8b46febe5e2b08b10394f654a84380a","collabId":"d8d9188b-4787-4579-a7ad-7d62e3498c41","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不存在隐式类型转换"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们必须显示转换使得参与运算的双方的类型是一致的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"229a45ec-8ae7-400d-8a72-ae73b93f9180","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9d8668a6-1349-4017-947c-70849d6f2217","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"fn main() {\n    let i = -1;\n    let f = 2.0;\n\n    let i_f = i as f64; // 显示将整数转换为浮点数\n\n    let num = i_f * f;\n\n    println!(\"{}\", num); // -2\n}","collabId":"aa353a90-0f92-456a-b7c5-c41ec129d3ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"tip","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"fc4e1fef-53ca-4fd5-8563-412fb248e0d9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2d06ff92-e6f3-4feb-bdf8-3decdb6998d9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"对于上述整数相乘，可以在声明变量时不指定类型，Rust 可以根据用法进行"},{"type":"content-link","refId":486,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","contentId":416,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"f04791f1-eb50-49ac-ada7-2831b2b05613","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"类型推导"}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"rs","uuid":"4f2a867e-cee9-425a-be87-ed5c98be9f28","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8d3081de-9408-423c-bec8-598d3ea1e19f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"fn main() {\n    let i1 = 1;\n    let i2: u32 = 2;\n    \n    let num = i1 * i2;\n    \n    println!(\"{}\", num);\n}","collabId":"23010ccc-4cfa-4be7-a058-a279d7b0cebc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f776626c-64d2-4d23-bfd6-b669b6dbc3ad","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"i1"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 会被自动推导为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"u32"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，不用显示声明或自动转换。"}]}]}],"tags":["Rust"],"createTime":1721089708893,"updateTime":1755938855100,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755938855100},"links":{"card:486":{"key":"card:486","type":"card","id":486}}}